@startuml
title Starter — Payment Event Flow

actor Producer
queue "dpw3-events" as Topic
rectangle "Consumer Group" as Group
rectangle "Consumer" as Consumer
rectangle "Processing" as Process

Producer --> Topic : event
Topic --> Group : records
Group --> Consumer : assigned partition
Consumer --> Process : process
Consumer --> Topic : commit offset

note right of Topic
Architecture decisions:
partition
event key
group
consumer count
end note
@enduml
